  "ruleText": "Liq 702.08 Additional information. In order to determine whether or not to approve the request for a license, the chairman or deputy commissioner may request additional information pursuant to RSA 178:3, V.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
